520
00:30:24.344 --> 00:30:26.221
EDDIE: <i>Oh, no. No.</i>

521
00:30:26.346 --> 00:30:28.472
<i>So you're telling me
we're carrying this thing.</i>

522
00:30:28.473 --> 00:30:30.309
